#title[= ML and Metalanguage dialects]
The central language of the #bkhack project is ML.\
  The idea is that each dialect of an object language emits a certain flavor
of programming style, favorable for some attractive qualities. The OCaml dialect encourages #lorem(30) The
Reason dialect encourages the use of modules as free namespaces, function
as parameterizable values, module functions as methods, and dissolution
of the separation of expression item and structural item; and besides
all of that, the exclusive ability to write JSX for defining reactive
component.\
  OCaml, Objective Caml, the latter stands for _Categorical Abstract Machine
language_. It is an application of the CAM model on basis of the malleable
ML language, #lorem(30)

